<title>USA: Fritz Cos in three-year pact with EQUATE.</title>
<headline>Fritz Cos in three-year pact with EQUATE.</headline>
<dateline>SAN FRANCISCO 1997-08-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Fritz Companies Inc. said it has signed a three-year contract to manage EQUATE Petrochemical Co's global distribution from Kuwait.</p>
<p>EQUATE, a joint venture of Union Carbide Corp and the Petrochemical Industries Co of Kuwait, is completing a $2 billion plant in Kuwait to produce polyethylene and ethylene glycol.</p>
<p>Production will start in October.</p>
<p>Fritz Companies said its Kuwaiti operation opened in April, sponsored by Kuwaiti partner Gulf Maritime General Trading &amp; Contracting, part of the Al-Kazemi International Group. - Air Cargo Newsroom Tel +44 171 542 7706 Fax +5017 - www.racs.com</p>
